{"metadata":{"extendedModule":"YubiKit","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HmacSecret","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7YubiKit5CTAP2O9ExtensionO10HmacSecretV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HmacSecret","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HmacSecret","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This extension allows a relying party to derive symmetric keys from a credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using HMAC-SHA-256 with user-provided salts. The derived keys can be used for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encryption or other cryptographic operations."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"MakeCredential-Usage","text":"MakeCredential Usage","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Request hmac-secret support when creating a credential:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret()","let ext = hmacSecret.makeCredential.input()","let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.makeCredential(params)","if let result = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ hmac-secret is enabled","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Or derive secrets at registration time (CTAP 2.2 hmac-secret-mc):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = try await CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret(session: session)","let ext = try hmacSecret.makeCr